    <briefdescription>
<para>Chinese calendar. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holidays: <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s day, January 1st (possibly followed by one or two more holidays) </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Labour Day, first week in May </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>National Day, one week from October 1st </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Other holidays for which no rule is given (data available for 2004-2011 only): <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Chinese New Year </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Ching Ming Festival </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Tuen Ng Festival </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Mid-Autumn Festival </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Data from <ulink url="http://www.sse.com.cn/sseportal/en/home/home.shtml">http://www.sse.com.cn/sseportal/en/home/home.shtml</ulink> </para>    </detaileddescription>
